# ====================
# 原有的 C/C++ 构建规则（已保留）
# ====================

# Prerequisites
*.d

# Compiled Object files
*.slo
*.lo
*.o
*.obj

# Precompiled Headers
*.gch
*.pch

# Linker files
*.ilk

# Debugger Files
*.pdb

# Compiled Dynamic libraries
*.so
*.dylib
*.dll
*.so.*

# Fortran module files
*.mod
*.smod

# Compiled Static libraries
*.lai
*.la
*.a
*.lib

# Executables
*.exe
*.out
*.app

# Build directories
build/
Build/
build-*/

# CMake generated files
CMakeFiles/
CMakeCache.txt
cmake_install.cmake
Makefile
install_manifest.txt
compile_commands.json

# Temporary files
*.tmp
*.log
*.bak
*.swp

# vcpkg
vcpkg_installed/

# debug information files
*.dwo

# test output & cache
Testing/
.cache/

# ====================
# 新增：Obsidian 笔记库专用规则
# ====================

# 1. 忽略 Obsidian 工作区布局文件（避免冲突的关键）
.obsidian/workspace.json
.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
.obsidian/cache
.obsidian/obsidian.json   # 有时会记录最近打开的笔记

# 2. 忽略 Excalidraw 自动导出的图片（避免冗余，可保留源码）
# 如果你用插件自动导出了 PNG/SVG，想保留就删掉下面两行
# *.excalidraw.png
# *.excalidraw.svg

# 3. 忽略系统文件
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# 4. 忽略临时笔记（如果你有的话）
*未命名.md
*temp.md
*草稿.md

# 5. 如果用了第三方同步工具
.sync/